# Play test of Gannet Rock (CIPlay gannet_rock, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the knoll's nests, the jetty out
# from the east shore and the fisherman's crate on its head, the treasure. Points as in its recipe.
island Gannet Rock
offset 0 0
expect animals Turtle 1
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 3
# Up on the knoll
at -3 1
expect height 6
# Along the jetty to its head, the crate
walk 13 0 to 20 0 to 30 0 h=1.5 below=4
expect stand 25 0.75 h=1.5 below=4
open Fisherman's crate
dig
